cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "[artifact] Decoys Cannot Go Everywhere: Mapping the Deception Surface in MITRE ATT&CK"
abstract: >-
  A dataset assessing where passive infrastructure deception can be
  deployed across the MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise matrix, scoring every technique
  on four criteria (feasibility, interaction, intelligence yield, malice
  fidelity) against a frozen rubric, with a written rationale per entry.
type: artifact
